# Ollama AI Integration Plan for NRCC

## Goal
Add AI capabilities to the Redmine Dashboard using Ollama cloud models as primary with local fallback.

## Requirements
- **AI Features**: Issue summarization, smart search, auto-categorization
- **Ollama Status**: Running at localhost:11434
- **Model Strategy**: Cloud models primary, local models fallback

### Model Selection
| Purpose | Primary (Cloud) | Fallback (Local) |
|---------|-----------------|------------------|
| Chat | `qwen3.5:cloud` | `gpt-oss:20b-cloud` |
| Embeddings | `nomic-embed-text-v2-moe:latest` | `nomic-embed-text:latest` |

